0..77 Comment "//! A Tarski universe closed under dependent pairs, with the decoder arm that"
78..96 Comment "//! stays refused."
97..100 Comment "//!"
101..180 Comment "//! Martin-Löf\'s universe is closed under dependent functions, dependent pairs"
181..257 Comment "//! and identity types. Each such code decodes to a family at the decodes of"
258..318 Comment "//! its fields. A decode thus stands as a family\'s argument."
319..322 Comment "//!"
323..398 Comment "//! A run binds a decode as a type of its own. A field at the code\'s decode"
399..429 Comment "//! then stands apart from it."
430..433 Comment "//!"
434..509 Comment "//! - see: `model/universe/pair-and-path-codes.gandr` — the pair and path"
510..559 Comment "//!   codes with their decodes in place, admitted"
560..616 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
617..620 Comment "//!"
621..793 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]: https://archive-pml.github.io/martin-lof/pdfs/Bibliopolis-Book-retypeset-1984.pdf \"Martin-Löf, Intuitionistic Type Theory\""
